  m_text: "Nina Hagen was born 2034 in Dover to an upper class family. After dropping
    out of college she slowly started to disconnect from her parents as she decided
    to walk her own path. When she isn\u2019t rallying she works full-time as a mechanic.\r\n\r\nSpecial
    effects:\r\nNina Hagen has spikes that damage everyone she collides with.\r\n"
